== Codex review round 3 (usage.go, usage_codexbar.go) ==
fixes: (1) runCodexbarCtx observes the leader with waitExitNoReap, kills the group, then cmd.Wait once (fallback unchanged where canWaitNoReap is false);
 (2) usageStore uses one persistWorker fed by a capacity-1 dirty channel (non-blocking send);
 (3) codexbar refresh: failed/skipped/timed-out fetch keeps the previous reading only under 30 min old, completed fetch with no valid windows clears the provider;
 (4) Codex selection compares parsed time.Time (parseCodexLineAt), formats only at the end.
tests added: TestUsageStoreSingleWorkerBoundedFlushes, TestReadCodexUsageSameSecondOrdering, TestCodexbarFailedFetchKeepsReadingOnlyWhileRecent, TestCodexbarCompletedFetchWithNoWindowsClearsProvider
